      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im training for a marathon and the muscle soreness after my long runs is getting pretty bad lately. its making it hard to sleep. what is the max amount of tylenol i can take in a day? i dont want to be under-dosed because i need to actually recover and rest properly. thanks",
